=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Deraquien} for a cutscene.
* Go to {z:La Theine Plateau} and speak with {n:Narvecaint} (F-7) at the entrance to {z:Ordelle's Caves} for another cutscene.
** Voidwatch warp to {z:Ordelle's Caves} will put you right next to the NPC.
* Return to {n:Deraquien} and speak to him again.
* Head to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak to {p:Halver}.
** If you just cleared {p:The Voracious Resurgence}, you will have to rezone after the cutscene you get and talk to him again.
* Speak to {n:Deraquien} again.
* Speak to {n:Phillone} (D-7).
* Go back to speak with {n:Deraquien}.
* Head to {z:Jugner Forest} through {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}.
** If you have access to the {p:Proto-Waypoint}, this is the fastest method of reaching the location.
* Click on the **???** at (F-5) between 18:00 and 4:00 to spawn two NMs; {m:Giollemitte B Feroun} and {m:Skeleton Esquire}.
** Both NMs must be defeated to proceed.
* Once defeated, click on the **???** again for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Phillone} for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Narvecaint} (F-7) in {z:La Theine Plateau}.
* Return to {n:Phillone} to receive your reward.

